{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"658001bf282e51775e6ffc53b280e70c2c9b1d75f02eec4f29a17ca43f7430c2","ja":"目指せ、豪華賞品！","zh":"目标是豪华奖品！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6fea755fd4f9adf59367d08cd3f30e84da30f6555df25503e7d1c4667c3f1b00","ja":"わぁ～っ、人がいっぱいだね。\nみんなウォークラリー大会の参加者なんだろうか？","zh":"哇～，人好多啊。\n大家都是徒步拉力赛大会的参加者吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b8e2f25b837da16bb767e0d91edb8ad32e443e43cfa72efef72685968d048b01","ja":"そうみたいね。地元で人気のイベントだけあるわ。\nカメラマンさんとはぐれないようにしないと。","zh":"看来是呢。不愧是在当地很受欢迎的活动。\n可不能和摄影师走散了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ef743dcd71be1b6e75d5a48b70ff408be217512e13d49db8f2fbb4027138eeff","ja":"えへへっ、みんなとイベントに出るの、\n楽しみだな～って♪","zh":"嘿嘿，我一想到能和大家\n一起参加活动，就特别期待呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"932d5d567311b48f86092346f608187e561513d739c27054c0c273cfb5dc19bc","ja":"うん、のんびりお散歩楽しめたらいいねぇ♪\n……あれ？","zh":"嗯，要是能悠闲地享受散步就好了呢♪\n……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"653e57cea10bd1f43d96bed605f3425fa2619b58a7b91ce60bd4f64fa5df2524","ja":"「今回の優勝賞品は……今が旬！\n豪華冬野菜と果物の盛り合わせです！」","zh":"“本次的优胜奖品是……正值当造！\n豪华冬令蔬菜与水果拼盘！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"125a8876f81463321b294fbb8435fe77d0038f1cfd0060d69ee4eb5508b31168","ja":"わぁ～！　なんだかキラキラして見えます！\nきっと、すっごく美味しいお野菜ですよっ！","zh":"哇～！总觉得看起来闪闪发光的！\n肯定是非常美味的蔬菜！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7f49ca0baf6cc12195581cf7ea96d348885e374ab2bbfb3b609d54bd51295b71","ja":"果物もみーんなべっぴんさんだねぇ。\nマスクメロンなんか、とっても甘そうだべさ……！","zh":"水果个个都长得真俊啊。\n那网纹甜瓜看着就可甜了……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a81426b269c2685ed87ad10b79ddfd6922371dcb62f051f953f6a37a81b5b7fe","ja":"そうね。なんだか、周りの参加者たちも\n目の色が変わったみたい……。","zh":"是啊。总觉得周围的参赛者们\n眼神好像也变了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"1d7e6e967be4826a315102d919fdedecfc5452ddec8d3a9b74ba2f55b0f10a0e","ja":"私、優勝したくなってきちゃいました！\n豪華冬野菜、欲しいです！","zh":"我也开始想要拿冠军了！\n好想得到豪华冬日蔬菜啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8b67aeec2e75552c447067ba15c1e9bf82feebabbeb1814911dcc7945e5aea2b","ja":"あたしも、食べてみたいべさ！","zh":"我也想尝尝看呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9e192bf6f61085b171c886e3aadeeb8682980e29ee8b4ef8766cf96dcf9abe2c","ja":"（……！　高槻さんと木下さんまで\n目の色が変わった……！）","zh":"（……！　连高槻和木下的\n眼神都变了……！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e781f922ccf368b6f2736c2e8b77bb4410e00e068d223c93ed7643a483ac0c2b","ja":"うっうー！　みんなで力を合わせれば\n優勝できますよね♪　それじゃあ出発しましょう～！","zh":"呜呜～！　只要大家齐心协力\n就一定能拿优胜对吧♪　那么我们就出发吧～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1128.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b109aaaf93612ee7afe2c7cf3987cc8e5763007949e9d881f5089d8c15ae3ae9","ja":"（そうね、ふたりがそんなに欲しいなら、\n優勝目指して私も頑張らないと……）","zh":"（也是呢，既然她们两个那么想要，\n我也得为了夺冠而加油了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
